  message: "DONE: fixed by WI-sinol's commit 2bf837be85, merged in PR #1381. CommonJS forms now read as exports: module.exports = f; module.exports = { f, k: g, m() {} }; exports.k = f; module.exports.k = f; chained `exports = module.exports = createApplication`. Evidence: test_js_ts_export_status.py (red on dev, green); on sharp the module_exports set went 169 -> 29, exactly the members of module.exports = {...} in lib/is.js and lib/libvips.js plus Sharp and getPath. Not covered: non-top-level (UMD `if`) or Object.assign/defineProperty exports (WI-kodop), function/class expressions assigned to an export (WI-rabod). Report: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/decontend/run_09302026/sinol.md"  # 4297
